    <title>E40 畅销书还值得读吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6695d1e87423d0d1e363ab03</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6695d1e87423d0d1e363ab03</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 16 Jul 2024 01:37:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>深夜狂性大发的罐头决定对照着《黑天鹅》和《Same as Ever》这两本书，探讨为什么大部分畅销书都是不值得细读的，以及如果要读应该带着什么心态去读。</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>提到的书：</span></p><span></span><ul><span> </span><li><span>《黑天鹅》by 塔勒布（不推荐）</span></li><span> </span><li><span>《Same as Ever》by Morgan Housel</span></li><span> </span><li><span>《Be Your Future Self Now》by Benjamin Hardy（不推荐）</span></li><span> </span><li><span>《哈佛短篇小说写作指南》by 约翰·盖利肖</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>【关于我】</span></p><span></span><p><span>罐头是个很有趣的概念。在你没打开之前我是封闭的，所以希望你来听我的播客，可以顺便把我打开，通过互动的方式带给我启发。先谢谢你啦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎邮箱来信：leisurecan@outlook.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>您可以在以下平台收听：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/5eb9eec1418a84a0461b1732?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlYjgyODg2MGRiZWQyMjI3MmNlZDM3YSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/5eb9eec1418a84a0461b1732?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlYjgyODg2MGRiZWQyMjI3MmNlZDM3YSJ9"><span>⁠⁠⁠小宇宙⁠⁠⁠</span></a><span>，</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/%e5%92%b8%e9%b1%bc%e7%bd%90%e5%a4%b4/id1512629000" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/%e5%92%b8%e9%b1%bc%e7%bd%90%e5%a4%b4/id1512629000"><span>⁠⁠⁠Apple Podcast⁠⁠⁠</span></a><span>，</span><a href="https://www.google.com/podcasts?feed=aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy8yMDgwOWY0Yy9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw==" data-url="https://www.google.com/podcasts?feed=aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy8yMDgwOWY0Yy9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw=="><span>⁠⁠⁠Google Podcast⁠⁠⁠</span></a><span>，</span><a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/1U3ag9YyTX5Lpu2hnRBCc7" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/show/1U3ag9YyTX5Lpu2hnRBCc7"><span>⁠⁠⁠Spotify⁠⁠⁠</span></a><span>，</span><a href="https://pca.st/xhl3wov1" data-url="https://pca.st/xhl3wov1"><span>⁠⁠⁠Pocket Casts⁠⁠⁠</span></a><span>，</span><a href="https://overcast.fm/itunes1512629000" data-url="https://overcast.fm/itunes1512629000"><span>⁠⁠⁠Overcast⁠⁠⁠</span></a></p>]]></description>
