  <item>
    <title>E38 逃离自恋型人格的魔爪</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66655ba8770c1cb47e01ce27</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66655ba8770c1cb47e01ce27</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 09 Jun 2024 07:16:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我将结合《为什么爱会伤人：亲密关系中的自恋型人格障碍》一书和自己的亲身经历，分析自恋型人格的特质和应对他们的方法。</span></p><span></span><ul><span> </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> “我们的社会是自恋型人格的培养皿”</span></li><span> </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="207">03:27</a> 为什么会陷入与自恋型人格的亲密关系？自恋型人格在“美女与野兽”故事中的体现</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="409">06:49</a> 自恋型人格的3个危险信号</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="649">10:49</a> 如何自救</span></li><span></span><p><br></p><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>引用：“我们在无知的程度上都是相似的。”——卡尔波普尔</span></p><span></span><p><span>配乐：Schubert - Erlkönig, D.328 (Piano: Hans Rosbaud) 这首钢琴曲名为《魔王》，讲述的是一个父亲抱着发烧的孩子在森林中狂奔，试图逃离魔王，但魔王还是威逼着孩子和自己离开，孩子最终失去生命。</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>【关于我】</span></p><span></span><p><span>罐头是个很有趣的概念。在你没打开之前我是封闭的，所以希望你来听我的播客，可以顺便把我打开，通过互动的方式带给我启发。先谢谢你啦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎邮箱来信：leisurecan@outlook.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>您可以在以下平台收听：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/5eb9eec1418a84a0461b1732?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlYjgyODg2MGRiZWQyMjI3MmNlZDM3YSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/5eb9eec1418a84a0461b1732?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlYjgyODg2MGRiZWQyMjI3MmNlZDM3YSJ9"><span>⁠⁠⁠小宇宙⁠⁠⁠</span></a><span>，</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/%e5%92%b8%e9%b1%bc%e7%bd%90%e5%a4%b4/id1512629000" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/%e5%92%b8%e9%b1%bc%e7%bd%90%e5%a4%b4/id1512629000"><span>⁠⁠⁠Apple Podcast⁠⁠⁠</span></a><span>，</span><a href="https://www.google.com/podcasts?feed=aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy8yMDgwOWY0Yy9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw==" data-url="https://www.google.com/podcasts?feed=aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy8yMDgwOWY0Yy9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw=="><span>⁠⁠⁠Google Podcast⁠⁠⁠</span></a><span>，</span><a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/1U3ag9YyTX5Lpu2hnRBCc7" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/show/1U3ag9YyTX5Lpu2hnRBCc7"><span>⁠⁠⁠Spotify⁠⁠⁠</span></