    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“他们说这是爱，我们说这是无偿劳动。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>西尔维娅·费代里奇在"Revolution at Point Zero"一书中是如何从马克思女权主义的视角看待家务劳动的？</span></p><span></span><ul><span> </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> 为什么家务劳动是无偿的</span></li><span> </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 为什么家务劳动被轻视</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> 女性主义者该与家庭主妇割席吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="517">08:37</a> 书名的意义</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">09:15</a> 女性的身材焦虑从何而来？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a> Incel的逻辑</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="837">13:57</a> 科技发展解放女性？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>提到的作品：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《父权制与资本主义》by 上野千鹤子</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《第二性》by 波伏娃</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《服美役：美是如何奴役和消费女性的》by 毛拉·甘奇塔诺</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>黄阿丽脱口秀"Don Wong"</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>开头提到的小红书博主：初一妈妈一拖二</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>配乐：Morning Therapy</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>【关于我】</span></p><span></span><p><span>罐头是个很有趣的概念。在你没打开之前我是封闭的，所以希望你来听我的播客，可以顺便把我打开，通过互动的方式带给我启发。先谢谢你啦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎邮箱来信：leisurecan@outlook.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>您可以在以下平台收听：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/5eb9eec1418a84a0461b1732?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlYjgyODg2MGRiZWQyMjI3MmNlZDM3YSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/5eb9eec1418a84a0461b1732?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlYjgyODg2MGRiZWQyMjI3MmNlZDM3YSJ9"><span>⁠⁠小宇宙⁠⁠</span></a><span>，</span><a href="https://podc