    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期灵感来自于讲座“How to Live an Asymmetric Life” by Graham Weaver，结合我的裸辞经历，我想聊聊：</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">01:28</a> 做自己热爱的事情 Do your own thing</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="193">03:13</a> 普拉提与攀岩教会我的</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="458">07:38</a> 自由一定伴随着责任</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="537">08:57</a> 墓碑设想</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>提到的书籍：</span></p><span></span><ul><span> </span><li><span>《跨越不可能》by 斯蒂芬科特勒</span></li><span> </span><li><span>《自由宪章》by 哈耶克，原文：“自己去发现一个用武之地和一份适当的职业，这乃是自由社会强加给我们的最为严格的戒律。”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>配乐： “Motions" by&nbsp;Rafael Krux</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>【关于我】</span></p><span></span><p><span>罐头是个很有趣的概念。在你没打开之前我是封闭的，所以希望你来听我的播客，可以顺便把我打开，通过互动的方式带给我启发。先谢谢你啦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎邮箱来信：leisurecan@outlook.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>您可以在以下平台收听：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/5eb9eec1418a84a0461b1732?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlYjgyODg2MGRiZWQyMjI3MmNlZDM3YSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/5eb9eec1418a84a0461b1732?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlYjgyODg2MGRiZWQyMjI3MmNlZDM3YSJ9"><span>⁠小宇宙⁠</span></a><span>，</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/%e5%92%b8%e9%b1%bc%e7%bd%90%e5%a4%b4/id1512629000" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/%e5%92%b8%e9%b1%bc%e7%bd%90%e5%a4%b4/id1512629000"><span>⁠Apple Podcast⁠</span></a><span>，</span><a href="https://www.google.com/podcasts?feed=aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy8yMDgwOWY0Yy9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw==" data-url="https://www.google.com/podcasts?feed=aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy8yMDgwOWY0Yy9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw=="><span>⁠Google Podcast⁠</span></a><span>，</span><a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/1U3ag9YyTX5Lpu2hnRBCc7" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/show/1U3ag9YyTX5Lpu2hnRBCc7"><span>⁠Spotify⁠</span></a><span>，</span><a href="https://pca.st/xhl3wov1" data-url="https://pca.st/xhl3wov1"><span>⁠Pocket Casts⁠</span></a><span>，</span><a href="https://overcast.fm/itunes1512629000" data-url="https://overcast.fm/itunes1512629000"><span>⁠Overcast⁠</span></a><span>，</span><a href="https://anchor.fm/s/20809f4c/podcast/rss" data-url="https://anchor.fm/s/20809f4c/podcast/rss"><span>⁠RSS</span></a></p>]]></description>
