  <item>
    <title>E29 选择即自由｜《生活与命运》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63b109c0fc7f36fc7d2f14a2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63b109c0fc7f36fc7d2f14a2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 01 Jan 2023 03:55:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2022年对许多人来说是艰难的一年，我一直在想要找一本什么样的书才能呼应今年发生的事。当你被生活和命运压得喘不过气的时候，就投入俄罗斯长篇巨作的怀抱吧。这一期给大家带来的是《生活与命运》。它的作者瓦西里·格罗斯曼仿佛要在这本书里燃尽自己的才华，他要我们相信， 人始终有选择的权利。愿新的一年大家得以拥抱更大的自由，新年快乐❤</span></p><span></span><ul><span> </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a> “长篇胸怀”</span></li><span> </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="193">03:13</a> “希望不是出于理智，希望是出于本能。”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">06:21</a> “命运带领着他，就像牵着一个小孩子。”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="458">07:38</a> “年复一年，每天，每时每刻都需要进行斗争，保卫自己做人的权利，保持纯洁与善良的权利。”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>特别感谢孜孜不倦催更的听友，尤其是兔子洞，尘埃野马，和我不跑调。谢谢你们代替宇宙发来的信号～</span></p><span></span><p><span>提到的作家：莫言的《生死疲劳》，萨特的原话 “you are free because you always have a choice, therefore choose.” (Sartre 2007)</span></p><span></span><p><span>配乐Parhelion by Alexander Nakarada</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于我】</span></p><span></span><p><span>罐头是个很有趣的概念。在你没打开之前我是封闭的，所以希望你来听我的播客，可以顺便把我打开，通过互动的方式带给我启发。先谢谢你啦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>您可以在以下平台收听：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/5eb9eec1418a84a0461b1732?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlYjgyODg2MGRiZWQyMjI3MmNlZDM3YSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/5eb9eec1418a84a0461b1732?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlYjgyODg2MGRiZWQyMjI3MmNlZDM3YSJ9"><strong><span>小宇宙</span></strong></a><span>，</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/%e5%92%b8%e9%b1%bc%e7%bd%90%e5%a4%b4/id1512629000" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/%e5%92%b8%e9%b1%bc%e7%bd%90%e5%a4%b4/id1512629000"><strong><span>Apple Podcast</span></strong></a><span>，</span><a href="https://www.google.com/podcasts?feed=aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy8yMDgwOWY0Yy9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw==" data-url="https://www.google.com/podcasts?feed=aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy8yMDgwOWY0Yy9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw=="><strong><span>Google Podcast</span></strong></a><span>，</span><a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/1U3ag9YyTX5Lpu2hnRBCc7" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/show/1U3ag9YyTX5Lpu2hnRBCc7"><strong><span>Spotify</span></strong></a><span>，</span><a href="https://pca.st/xhl3wov1" data-url="https://pca.st/xhl3wov1"><strong><span>Pocket Casts</span></strong></a><span>，</span><a href="https://overcast.fm/itunes1512629000" data-url="https://overcast.fm/itunes1512629000"><strong><span>Overcast</span></strong></a><span>，</span><a href="https://anchor.fm/s/20809f4c/podcast/rss" data-url="https://anchor.fm/s/20809f4c/podcast/rss"><strong><span>RSS</span></strong></a></p>]]></description>
