    <pubDate>Sat, 04 Sep 2021 04:29:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一本充满电影感的科幻短篇，内含福利🎁</span></p><span></span><p><span>你将听到：</span></p><span></span><ul><span> </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">1:42</a> 反差反差再反差</span></li><span> </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">4:00</a> 眼见为虚，心化为实</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="336">5:36</a>&nbsp;吃喝拉撒的重要性</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="462">07:42</a> 此书不怕剧透</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="524">8:44</a> 让主播眼馋的赠书福利</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="568">9:28</a> 一个嘴瓢的彩蛋</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【赠书福利】</span></p><span></span><p><span>不知道大家听完有没有对这本书产生兴趣呢，欢迎分享你阅读科幻小说的经历和理由，或者是喜欢的科幻作品。如果你不常看科幻，也可以讲讲你期待看到怎样的科幻作品。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我会在小宇宙的评论区，抽1条点赞数最高的评论和2条精选评论，送出这本由译林出版社提供的《未来学大会》，每一本还带周边。九月底之前开奖。</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目起源于西夏酒馆的主播伊夏发起的莱姆精读计划。你还将在友台陆续听到其他莱姆的代表作：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>西夏酒馆《伊甸》，《惨败》；</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>痴人之爱《索拉里斯星》；</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>不丧《无敌号》；</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>落日间《其主之声》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>敬请期待~</span></p><span></span><p><span>特别鸣谢封面照片的摄影师书鬼</span></p><span></span><p><span>配乐Blue Dot Sessions - Flatlands 2nd</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>【关于我】</span></p><span></span><p><span>罐头是个很有趣的概念。在你没打开之前我是封闭的，所以希望你来听我的播客，可以顺便把我打开，通过互动的方式带给我启发。先谢谢你啦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>您可以在以下平台收听：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/5eb9eec1418a84a0461b1732?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlYjgyODg2MGRiZWQyMjI3MmNlZDM3YSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/5eb9eec1418a84a0461b1732?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlYjgyODg2MGRiZWQyMjI3MmNlZDM3YSJ9"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span>，</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/%e5%92%b8%e9%b1%bc%e7%bd%90%e5%a4%