    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一本让我结束了倦怠期的书。</span></p><span></span><ul><span> </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a> 如何利用图书馆骗自己读书</span></li><span> </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">03:15</a> “老人”、“埋骨之地”和“一被子的悲伤”</span></li><span> </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="594">09:54</a> 惊心动魄的故事 vs 钝刀割肉的真实</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>感谢在各个平台催更的听众们，没有你们的不懈努力就没有这期</span></p><span></span><p><span>配乐：Lonely Stairwell by Blue Dot Sessions</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>【关于我】</span></p><span></span><p><span>罐头是个很有趣的概念。在你没打开之前我是封闭的，所以希望你来听我的播客，可以顺便把我打开，通过互动的方式带给我启发。先谢谢你啦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>您可以在以下平台收听：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/5eb9eec1418a84a0461b1732?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlYjgyODg2MGRiZWQyMjI3MmNlZDM3YSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/5eb9eec1418a84a0461b1732?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlYjgyODg2MGRiZWQyMjI3MmNlZDM3YSJ9"><strong><span>小宇宙</span></strong></a><span>，</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/%e5%92%b8%e9%b1%bc%e7%bd%90%e5%a4%b4/id1512629000" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/%e5%92%b8%e9%b1%bc%e7%bd%90%e5%a4%b4/id1512629000"><strong><span>Apple Podcast</span></strong></a><span>，</span><a href="https://www.google.com/podcasts?feed=aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy8yMDgwOWY0Yy9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw==" data-url="https://www.google.com/podcasts?feed=aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy8yMDgwOWY0Yy9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw=="><strong><span>Google Podcast</span></strong></a><span>，</span><a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/1U3ag9YyTX5Lpu2hnRBCc7" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/show/1U3ag9YyTX5Lpu2hnRBCc7"><strong><span>Spotify</span></strong></a><span>，</span><a href="https://pca.st/xhl3wov1" data-url="https://pca.st/xhl3wov1"><strong><span>Pocket Casts</span></strong></a><span>，</span><a href="https://overcast.fm/itunes1512629000" data-url="https://overcast.fm/itunes1512629000"><strong><